---
import DocsShell from '../../components/docs/DocsShell.astro';
import { INSTALL_TOOLS } from '../../lib/install-tools';
---

<DocsShell
	title="Install by agent"
	description="Pick your agent: where it reads skills, the skillpass add command that installs there, and a prompt to paste in. Every SkillPass skill works with every listed tool."
>
	<p>
		Every skill on SkillPass installs into every tool below. Pick yours for the folders it reads, the exact{' '}
		<code>skillpass add</code> command, and a prompt you can paste into the agent instead of running the CLI yourself.
	</p>
	<ul>
		{INSTALL_TOOLS.map((tool) => (
			<li>
				<a href={`/install/${tool.slug}`}>{tool.name}</a> - <code>{tool.project}/</code>
			</li>
		))}
	</ul>

	<h2>Another tool</h2>
	<p>
		Anything that reads the shared <code>.agents/skills</code> folder installs with <code>--target agents</code>. For
		any other location, <code>skillpass add &lt;slug&gt; --dir &lt;path&gt;</code> writes the skill exactly where you
		point it. The <a href="/docs/cli">CLI guide</a> has the full command reference.
	</p>
</DocsShell>
